<title>UKRAINE: Port conditions update - Ukraine - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Ukraine - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>ODESSA, Oct 21 - Alongside, two steel loaders, one tanker loader and one general cargo vessel. One general cargo vessel at anchorage.</p>
<p>ILICHEVSK, Oct 21 - Alongside, nine steel loaders and one container vessel. One discharging tanker and one general cargo vessel at anchorage.</p>
</text>
